From Alpine's community/hledger (update-persistent.patch).
persistent 2.18.1.0, the newest release, says template-haskell < 2.24; GHC
9.14.1 ships 2.24. Require persistent >= 2.18 and lift that one bound
(cabal.project already lifts its aeson bound), so cabal can use it on GHC
9.14.1.

diff --git a/cabal.project b/cabal.project
index 4b451c2ce..3aa38f2d0 100644
--- a/cabal.project
+++ b/cabal.project
@@ -28,3 +28,5 @@ write-ghc-environment-files: always
 -- package *
 --     -- Speeds up a bit
 --     library-vanilla: False
+constraints: persistent >=2.18
+allow-newer: persistent:template-haskell
